    "detailed_description": "<h1>SUBCRIBE NULLFRAMES YOUTUBE CHANNEL FOR UPCOMING VIDEOS</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/0ec67b617908cf41fa760a94318620f2.avif?t=1659435773\" /></div></p><br><h1>WATCH TRAILER 4K</h1><p></p><br><h1>JOIN OFFICIAL DISCORD CHANNEL</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/bdfebcd0354e80bc20d4174b53352fb4.avif?t=1659435773\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/a2674675f7876e10f744b59b0f91798b.poster.avif?t=1659435773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/a2674675f7876e10f744b59b0f91798b.webm?t=1659435773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/a2674675f7876e10f744b59b0f91798b.mp4?t=1659435773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/72be0856d8c6bf7eeafa9b3597571ecf.webp?t=1659435773\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>War</strong></h2><br>Make rapid combos against your enemies with one-handed weapons, Strike great blows to the king\u2019s guard with two-handed weapons, Don't even give them a chance to recover with your wizardry skills, Silently destroy your enemies with ejection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diplomacy</strong></h2><br>Engage in dialogues with the characters and manage your relationships wisely! Improve your diplomacy skill to win battles without using a sword.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Fantasy/Medieval World</strong></h2><br>Stroll around taverns in the city and village, fight duels, engage in dialogues. Initiate intrigues in the palace of the great king. Follow the whispers in the forest and take your revenge!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience the Story</strong></h2><br>Live medieval fantasy to the fullest by shaping the story with your choices and actions in this content where revenge, war, and politics are intertwined!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/72be0856d8c6bf7eeafa9b3597571ecf.webp?t=1659435773\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/a2674675f7876e10f744b59b0f91798b.poster.avif?t=1659435773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/a2674675f7876e10f744b59b0f91798b.webm?t=1659435773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/a2674675f7876e10f744b59b0f91798b.mp4?t=1659435773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/72be0856d8c6bf7eeafa9b3597571ecf.webp?t=1659435773\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>War</strong></h2><br>Make rapid combos against your enemies with one-handed weapons, Strike great blows to the king\u2019s guard with two-handed weapons, Don't even give them a chance to recover with your wizardry skills, Silently destroy your enemies with ejection.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diplomacy</strong></h2><br>Engage in dialogues with the characters and manage your relationships wisely! Improve your diplomacy skill to win battles without using a sword.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Fantasy/Medieval World</strong></h2><br>Stroll around taverns in the city and village, fight duels, engage in dialogues. Initiate intrigues in the palace of the great king. Follow the whispers in the forest and take your revenge!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience the Story</strong></h2><br>Live medieval fantasy to the fullest by shaping the story with your choices and actions in this content where revenge, war, and politics are intertwined!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399530/extras/72be0856d8c6bf7eeafa9b3597571ecf.webp?t=1659435773\" /></div>",
